>**Raises nation's Prosperity, Resources and Supplies at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
* This Op is only available when either {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} or {z:Xarcabard (S)} (or both) is **NOT** beastmen-controlled. __(verification needed)__
* Receive the mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Join {p:Campaign Battles|Category:Campaign Battle} in any nation-controlled area in {p:The Fauregandi Front} or {p:The Valdeaunia Front|Category:The Valdeaunia Front}.
* After completing the Objective, report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To complete this mission you MUST participate in Campaign battles in non-Beastmen controlled zones.
* You need 5000 EXP to complete this Campaign Op.
* You will receive your mission reward along with the Campaign battle assessment immediately after your objective has been completed.

=2 Objective
Beastman Confederate forces are now planning full-scale sieges on Allied strongholds on the Northern Front. Join the struggle in these decisive Campaign battles and assist our mercenaries of the Cobra Unit in defending these key strategic points.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
